(7408968, 1167517, 38032, '<td valign="top">I want to turn the chair in the foreground to a more welcoming position. I also want to removed the flowers or whatever form around MOlly''s nose.  OTher than that, one of my faves of the challenge. The light, color, composition and environment are really nice  -I just feel a bit too detached from it.</td>', 'I want to turn the chair in the foreground to a more welcoming position. I also want to removed the flowers or whatever form around MOlly''s nose.  OTher than that, one of my faves of the challenge. The light, color, composition and environment are really nice  -I just feel a bit too detached from it.', '2015-10-08 10:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
