(7409636, 1167204, 58634, '<td valign="top">Way too overprocessed. Nothing seems to be in good focus, and you have random patches of blur throughout the picture that don''t seem to serve a purpose..</td>', 'Way too overprocessed. Nothing seems to be in good focus, and you have random patches of blur throughout the picture that don''t seem to serve a purpose..', '2015-10-12 18:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409637, 1167530, 58634, '<td valign="top">Really pretty light. Some might not like it, but I feel it adds a certain magic to this.</td>', 'Really pretty light. Some might not like it, but I feel it adds a certain magic to this.', '2015-10-12 18:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409638, 1167557, 58634, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful texture. So intricate that it''s almost geometric.</td>', 'Really beautiful texture. So intricate that it''s almost geometric.', '2015-10-12 18:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409639, 1167518, 58634, '<td valign="top">Despite the creepy and ugly factor, the lighting here seems way too harsh; probably due to the use of flash?</td>', 'Despite the creepy and ugly factor, the lighting here seems way too harsh; probably due to the use of flash?', '2015-10-12 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409640, 1167403, 58634, '<td valign="top">The only thing that (for some reason) bothers me about this image is the fact that his eyes are closed. Other than that, I find it to be a fantastic shot. Really nicely lit, to put emphasis on the sparks and I really like the way the smoke looks and how your eye is drawn to it. It even lights his face in a natural way.</td>', 'The only thing that (for some reason) bothers me about this image is the fact that his eyes are closed. Other than that, I find it to be a fantastic shot. Really nicely lit, to put emphasis on the sparks and I really like the way the smoke looks and how your eye is drawn to it. It even lights his face in a natural way.', '2015-10-12 18:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409641, 1167532, 58634, '<td valign="top">Hopefully he''s not being overly criticized...</td>', 'Hopefully he''s not being overly criticized...', '2015-10-12 18:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409643, 1167490, 58634, '<td valign="top">I know she''s walking, but it seems like a dance.</td>', 'I know she''s walking, but it seems like a dance.', '2015-10-12 18:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409644, 1167495, 58634, '<td valign="top">Artistically, this seems a bit too literal for the challenge for my taste. There''s no concept for the image, no set up, no mood, no scenery.. It almost looks like a picture that''ll be used as a hairstyle example for a hair salon''s magazine. Not trying to be harsh, just stating my opinion.</td>', 'Artistically, this seems a bit too literal for the challenge for my taste. There''s no concept for the image, no set up, no mood, no scenery.. It almost looks like a picture that''ll be used as a hairstyle example for a hair salon''s magazine. Not trying to be harsh, just stating my opinion.', '2015-10-12 18:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409645, 1167571, 58634, '<td valign="top">The subtle contrast and the movement blur give this such a beautiful depth.</td>', 'The subtle contrast and the movement blur give this such a beautiful depth.', '2015-10-12 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409646, 1167555, 58634, '<td valign="top">Like a postcard!</td>', 'Like a postcard!', '2015-10-12 18:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409649, 1167487, 54778, '<td valign="top">You have all the ingredients for a strong photograph but I think the light kind of waffles in the middle. Either you could have made a strong silhouette with very little detail showing upfront with only the highlighted cigarette or used another light source to highlight the face more strongly while retaining the backlight that highlights the smoke nicely.</td>', 'You have all the ingredients for a strong photograph but I think the light kind of waffles in the middle. Either you could have made a strong silhouette with very little detail showing upfront with only the highlighted cigarette or used another light source to highlight the face more strongly while retaining the backlight that highlights the smoke nicely.', '2015-10-12 19:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7409650, 1167387, 54778, '<td valign="top">Cute photo! I do wish the focus covered both the noses and their eyes.</td>', 'Cute photo! I do wish the focus covered both the noses and their eyes.', '2015-10-12 19:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
