(7409951, 1167403, 54778, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Revecca:</b></div><hr/><i> The only thing that (for some reason) bothers me about this image is the fact that his eyes are closed. Other than that, I find it to be a fantastic shot. Really nicely lit, to put emphasis on the sparks and I really like the way the smoke looks and how your eye is drawn to it. It even lights his face in a natural way. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The eye thing is probably what ties it in with the title. The man has protective glasses on the top of his head but decided to take a risk and go on without them. It was obviously a poor idea since he couldn''t look at the sparks for long. Thank you for looking.</td>', 'Originally posted by Revecca: The only thing that (for some reason) bothers me about this image is the fact that his eyes are closed. Other than that, I find it to be a fantastic shot. Really nicely lit, to put emphasis on the sparks and I really like the way the smoke looks and how your eye is drawn to it. It even lights his face in a natural way.   The eye thing is probably what ties it in with the title. The man has protective glasses on the top of his head but decided to take a risk and go on without them. It was obviously a poor idea since he couldn''t look at the sparks for long. Thank you for looking.', '2015-10-14 15:17:27.000000', NULL, 0),
